        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TL;DR: think of this game as Dwarf Fortress of survivors genre. Your first impression is probably gonna be like &quot;WHAT THE .... IS ALL OF THIS?!&quot;, but if you give it just a little bit of effort in understanding - a majestic beast will appear before you.</i><br><br>Purge the planes from xenos that awaken the forces of entropy from slumber. <br>Every run is the a new &quot;puzzle&quot;, and your build is the key. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/fbc7e0f1f3a0feaad6faf010c5500b30.poster.avif?t=1765326960\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/fbc7e0f1f3a0feaad6faf010c5500b30.webm?t=1765326960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/fbc7e0f1f3a0feaad6faf010c5500b30.mp4?t=1765326960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The game is moderately+ skill-based and heavily  focused on the initial replayability - dynamic &amp; chaotic combat, vast array of enemies, tasks &amp; mechanics. Tons of builds.  <br><br> The backend is sprinkled with several meta-upgrade systems.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/48241981c91647530fa93d7a66661dfb.webp?t=1765326960\" width=780 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/2096db4a7a05dfe9f7cb94e90f5d6262.avif?t=1765326960\" width=594 height=598 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mindless grind - your quest is finite, and every bit of effort counts.  <br>Ravage through the map areas, unlock artifacts, craft builds and grow in power. <br>Enemy will also not sit and wait for their demise, growing in power during a run, and reinforcing their global areas with buffs.<br> <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/605460235283293156cb20fed22d64c8.webp?t=1765326960\" width=780 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/9c3ccf9bbde580bd4a58c3f342c80ba0.poster.avif?t=1765326960\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/9c3ccf9bbde580bd4a58c3f342c80ba0.webm?t=1765326960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/9c3ccf9bbde580bd4a58c3f342c80ba0.mp4?t=1765326960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On THE PATH to species annihilation, every mission will present an array of optional tasks to prevent the player mindlesly running in circles, and giving generous rewards. <br>However, there will be crucial and difficult tasks (a.k.a. bosses and sub-bosses), that are mandatory for completion.<br><br><br><br>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/6781d43cdca037e17132123c76da8942.webp?t=1765326960\" width=780 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/6dec23a9a52511d1e5a1cd2cc55be8cc.poster.avif?t=1765326960\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as