.</strong> 20+ active and passive perks;   <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/6a1db6f479e3684007cfbf7c23d2646e.avif?t=1765326960\" width=1348 height=694 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3.</strong> Inventory system of 12 slots of items, that can be equipped during the mission;    <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/09b6b46d2a88e4f74aa1cab37ac497e9.avif?t=1765326960\" width=1560 height=804 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4.</strong> 30+ items to choose from, with a total of 600+ different upgrade slots (each 3 levels deep);   <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/cb6e0f528b789fc0788dc3ae84385efb.avif?t=1765326960\" width=1232 height=742 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/5ea251f1e0a18b708f5aa452457f7183.avif?t=1765326960\" width=1036 height=736 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong> </strong> <br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/4bb4790b81a793ab70740265dcc4f5a4.webp?t=1765326960\" width=780 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/44358f5ccfe668763bff3d3d803b4f9a.avif?t=1765326960\" width=1408 height=790 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>30+</strong> enemy unit types with their own set of stats, attacks (no touch-damage), skills, perks, ai, pathing patterns and so on.    <br>- <strong>Squads</strong>, enemy group compositions with custom pathing, traits and mechanics.   <br>- <strong>Valor</strong> enemy system, units upgrade their <strong><i>stats</i></strong><i> <strong>&amp;</strong> <strong>perks</strong></i> during the run.   <br>- <strong>Force</strong> enemy system giving the enemy different benefits, spawning squads and elites.   <br> - <strong>Engage</strong> enemy system, new enemy types are unlocked in random compositions during each run, presenting a different challenge every time.  <br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/0531f72e4e0bd7e7bbef2cdfa3af3c26.avif?t=1765326960\" width=780 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Futhermore, those unit types <strong>stats</strong> <strong>&amp;</strong> <strong>perks</strong> are unlocked dynamicaly (Ex: enemy can get 4x of the same perk, making it very strong/fast/resourcefull, or 4 different ones, making it more versatile), promoting even more gameplay variation.   <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/3374041ca6c66b5c183744293e8b6437.poster.avif?t=1765326960\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/3374041ca6c66b5c183744293e8b6437.webm?t=1765326960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/3374041ca6c66b5c183744293e8b6437.mp4?t=1765326960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/e6b80ce7014a9c6158f219e2127552f6.webp?t=1765326960\" width=780 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/70b49104d8e4284bd34cd86d5f63a784.avif?t=1765326960\" width=1560 height=836 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/82d0766bfb3e0daaad8c8040aa51302c.avif?t=1765326960\" width=1560 height=692 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558900/extras/ee609aeea99d05ec1c1cc03d9e975e48.avif?t=1765326960\" width=1560 height=822 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an awakened entropy force, you constantly grow in power, obtaining stars (socketables) and combining them in the Membrane Matrix to achieve different boosts, based on their placement and their link interconnections.    <br>   <br><i>Xenos fall is imminent, annihilate all!</i></p>",
        "short_description": "Fast-paced, skill-based, chaotic &amp; hardcore &quot;survivors&quot; game, with huge array of builds, enemy variety and tons of mechanics. The game is primarily designed for &quot;true&quot; gamers that love the genre and seek a challenge.",
